  ],
  "revision_notes": {
    "round5_issue_1": "RESOLVED — miniF2F-v2 Revisited corrected from 'ICLR 2026' to 'NeurIPS 2025' (confirmed via neurips.cc/virtual/2025/poster/118598). Authors: Ospanov, Farnia, Mohit.",
